-  RegisterFirstPartySetsComponent(cus);
-  RegisterPrivacySandboxAttestationsComponent(cus);
+  // De-Googled build: several components below are not registered.
+  //
+  // Each registration tells update.googleapis.com that this install exists and
+  // asks it for data, carrying a component id, a version, an install date, a
+  // freshness value and a cohort. That is worth paying for a component the
+  // browser uses and not for one it does not. Registrations that carry security
+  // or web compatibility are kept and listed further down.
+  //
+  // SubresourceFilter enforces the Better Ads standard, and Safe Browsing is what
+  // designates a site as abusive. This build has no Safe Browsing handler, so
+  // nothing can ever trigger the filter, and uBlock Origin ships here anyway.
+  //
+  // OnDeviceHeadSuggest is a Google-built omnibox suggestion model. Suggestions
+  // come from the chosen engine instead.
+  //
